  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Rumor has it that Chae Ha-Rin is sleeping with her boss, Director Moon Jung-Hoo. Then one steamy night, she does. Ha-Rin wants their relationship to stay physical, but Jung-Hoo keeps confessing. He insists that Ha-Rin loves him as well as his body... and she's afraid he might be right! Still, Ha-Rin's not willing to let Jung-Hoo make promises he can't keep. Can Jung-Hoo convince Ha-Rin to build something pure from their indecent romance? Or will she prove they're nothing more than another office scandal?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
